English summary (non-binding, the French text above prevails)

You may use, modify and redistribute this software freely, including
commercially, provided that the SISKO logo, the authorship notice and the
integrity-verification mechanism described in Article 3 remain intact and
functional. Removing, hiding or neutralising them, for any reason, by any
person or automated agent, terminates the licence. Your business data remains
yours at all times, in an open format, and is never transmitted anywhere.
The software is provided without warranty and is not certified accounting
software.
